 src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268910/extras/04c471167307fa1909423fe4e64a15a1.avif?t=1749830921\" width=800 height=167 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RUNES:</strong>Find and Collect them during the Game.They are useful to Heal yourself or to revive your Teammates.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blessing:</strong>Your Choise, Good or Bad.<br>Both decisions will have an Impact on your Gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERKS</strong>:<br>Customize your hunter the way you want. There are different options to modify your character.</p></li></ul>",
